s in common parlance. In fact, lawyers frequently talk past each other when using the term because they are referring to different facets or concepts of ‘data’. Much confusion has been caused, in particular, by the varying use of the terms ‘information’ on the one hand and ‘data’ on the other. These Princi - Principle 3 ALI-ELI PRINCIPLES FOR A DATA ECONOMY"